# APEX GitHub Release Scope Audit -- additive hardening (the specific
# .env.bak*/.env.verify_tmp/.env.local entries above already cover the
# actual files found in this repo; this blanket pattern is extra
# margin for any future .env.<name> file, while the negation keeps the
# safe, placeholder-only .env.example tracked as intended).
.env.*
!.env.example

